<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-30T20:57:04.558Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:57:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have stepped up cross-border strikes, shooting missiles at Saudi airports and oil facilities and launching a drone toward Mecca that Saudi air defenses intercepted, while another drone was destroyed over the Medina region. Saudi air defenses also intercepted missiles over Riyadh, and a Saudi strike killed 12 people in a residential area of Yemen. Fighting continues near Taiz as UN agencies warn that hospitals are buckling under the intensified combat. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPUnhpZVZHQUliUnJIQUJWb3JmbVl6VV9GZ3NJN0M3X0EzZU9pa2N4SEcybGNlakZkcmxyeVNqV0E5LWRxTU1VZUM4Uk9TdGZTS0RJLU1CZ1JVVFBlM0pTcWFPd2U0b1RFTkVyV2oxSzNwZzYzMjBwVmRtbUFvWUowS1RPSEQ3eE1Qa2ZQQVJ5SExsbzVXQTQtNlZYRC1Bbnh2YmpnZ2VGaHZLQlJDRWJRZEZOU2VCZ1hPcENQcTUtYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOSTJ1aldqaEJHVUQ4NjY5aC12UUxXQkVTWXJQenpCUDVqNVhQc19LWmM2Q0lDQzZleGlSUDRwSld0VHlMb3BkekZSUDBabFV5b2QzZUNRSDVTY05xLVpsQ2NCNkhOYU9VNnJsVkpoVWVqZ1E3U0Y2Tnp2X3F4R2dSNHJsNXhwRGxkMlpmUEVjMnNqd09OYm9WY0pGRWRjYmktdi1BTWk2akZ1aVJlTUdfXzBEdUpVQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNdjlEdVpUWnZWZVNQY0pHVWFxaU04OEN3NGFfUlFhcGZjc1dBLXh3WFZWTEl5LU5vMXdYR3Y3eDVaVDNaMV8xamdhdXNDUWwwRlZNZjNMakJHekZnUDNfZDROaXlkWjJDT28yS0wyNFZaZExIRE5NWDdhTW5LUDgzUm02alJONllSYURyc3RDQklObEhYLThVaXNHOG5GQjlGUmNxNl9Cay0wVDk0dVZLdjVHRDl6Y0xQMC1xdnhhWGU5VzlLYnVjcU9VMFAzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BNN Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar